# Claude Code
.claude/
# Note: We might want to keep .claude/ in the repo as it contains our configuration.
# But if we want to allow local overrides, we could ignore .claude/ and keep only example files.
# For now, we are keeping .claude/ in the repo as it contains the standard configuration.
# However, we should consider adding .claude/local.json or similar for local overrides.
# For this repository, we are keeping the standard .claude/ as part of the template.
